[[File:Amulet of rancour detail.png|left|130px]]
The '''amulet of rancour''' is the upgraded variant of the [[amulet of torture]] requiring level 90 [[Hitpoints]] to wear, providing best in slot [[melee strength]] and melee attack bonuses in all three types. It is made with level 86 [[Crafting]] by attaching the [[araxyte fang]] to an [[amulet of torture]], requiring a rare untradeable drop from [[Araxxor]].

Compared to the [[amulet of torture]], the amulet of rancour gains +10 melee attack bonuses and +2 strength bonus, but with negative bonuses for magic and ranged attacks.

The amulet of rancour can be recoloured to an [[amulet of rancour (s)]] by speaking to a [[Man (Morytania Spider Cave)|man]] at the end of a series of tunnels within the [[Morytania Spider Cave]], each of which have various requirements to pass through as alluded to in the [[venom-riddled note]].

